==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pinky Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

